== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier 3 Pets|Tier 3]] upgrade of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Ebonsand Behemoth}}. Offline production increases. Spawns mana sources depending on Mana available. While Idle Mode is off, profits increase with time spent this Exile.

Gain experience each second.

== Pet Ability ==

Multiplies Offline production by:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.5} \times 0.25 + 1</math>


While Idle mode is Off, multiplies profits by:
<br><math>P^{0.5} \times L \times T^{4.5} \times 0.002 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>T = 3 + \text{Played Game Time, in Days}</math>
After 11 days:
* <math>T = \left(\text{Played Game Time, in Days}-11\right)^{0.1}+14</math>

Each second, grants 1 mana source whose cost does not exceed All Mana This Realm.

''Note: As this is not an ability activation, it is unaffected by {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Whiplash}} and {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Collar Of Obedience}}.''

Charges all non-shard spells by 1% every second.

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>(2 + F) \times 3 \times M</math>

where:
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

